lected from a text or speech corpus. When the items are words, n-grams may also be called shingles.[1]  An n-gram of size 1 is referred to as a \"unigram\"; size 2 is a \"bigram\" (or, less commonly, a \"digram\"); size 3 is a \"trigram\". Larger sizes are sometimes referred to by the value of n, e.g., \"four-gram\", \"five-gram\", and so on.","topics":[],"score":229793,"global_rank":113251},{"name":"hayate0721/sugarscape_ds","owner":"hayate0721","html_url":"https://github.com/hayate0721/sugarscape_ds","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229791,"global_rank":113259},{"name":"delhatch/AMFM_SDR","owner":"delhatch","html_url":"https://github.com/delhatch/AMFM_SDR","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Stand-alone radio based on an SDR. No PC required.","topics":[],"score":229791,"global_rank":113262},{"name":"Cool-Coder174/STAT212","owner":"Cool-Coder174","html_url":"https://github.com/Cool-Coder174/STAT212","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Labs for STATS 212 using Pandas, PyXL and Python","topics":[],"score":229791,"global_rank":113265},{"name":"Xayah-Hina/PI-NGP","owner":"Xayah-Hina","html_url":"https://github.com/Xayah-Hina/PI-NGP","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229791,"global_rank":113268},{"name":"EyasR/template","owner":"EyasR","html_url":"https://github.com/EyasR/template","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229791,"global_rank":113270},{"name":"tyfiero/crewai_hackathon","owner":"tyfiero","html_url":"https://github.com/tyfiero/crewai_hackathon","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":229791,"global_rank":113272},{"name":"lunatrifx/LovelaceIV","owner":"lunatrifx","html_url":"https://github.com/lunatrifx/LovelaceIV